trail.ford|ford|брод
trail.ford-stones|ford, stepping stones|брод по камням

# Barriers, named so the gate on a track reads as one.
barrier.gate|Gate|Ворота
barrier.lift_gate|Lift gate|Шлагбаум
barrier.swing_gate|Swing gate|Поворотные ворота
barrier.kissing_gate|Kissing gate|Калитка
